.\" Keep this page current: it describes the demo game demos/climb2.bas (an executable made with BUILD, installed by "make install").
.TH ENGINE1999-CLIMB2 6 "November 2026" "Engine 1999 @VERSION@" "Engine1999 Manual"
.SH NAME
engine1999-climb2 \- The Long Climb II, a jump and run game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B engine1999-climb2
.SH DESCRIPTION
The Long Climb II is the second edition. New: a giant ice cream cone of 3 x 3 sprites (a sprite group) wobbles over the stand on the roof, the birds of the title screen fly on sprite paths, and from the upper floors on bolts fall from the cranes: each one spins down the screen on a path of its own, and one that hits the worker costs a life. The Long Climb is a jump and run game. You are a construction worker, and the ice cream stand is on the roof of an unfinished steel tower, 960 pixels above the street. Climb the ladders, jump the gaps, hurdles, cars and birds, and use your drill to make holes in the girders: a rust ball or slime that walks into a hole is trapped, and when the hole closes again, it is gone for a while. You have no weapon. The world scrolls smoothly; every new climb is a little faster.
.PP
The program is the demo \fIclimb2.bas\fR of Engine1999, made into an executable with
.B BUILD
(window kind: it needs the SDL2 library, nothing else); its BASIC libraries are inside it. It opens the Engine1999 window; the window can
be switched between the full screen and a window with F11 or ALT+RETURN.
.SH CONTROLS
.TP
.BR LEFT / RIGHT " or " A / D
walk (only while the key is held).
.TP
.BR UP / DOWN " or " W / S
climb a ladder.
.TP
.B SPACE
jump.
.TP
.BR Z / X " or " , / .
drill a hole in the girder to your left / right.
.TP
.B M
music on or off.
.TP
.B P
pause.
.TP
.B Q
quit.
.PP
A game controller works, too: D-pad or left stick walks and climbs, A jumps, X or LB and B or RB drill left and right, Y switches the music, START pauses, BACK quits.
.SH FILES
The best height is kept in the file
.I climb2.hi
in the current directory (the game goes on without it if the file cannot be written).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR engine1999 (1),
.BR engine1999-basic (7),
.BR engine1999-climb (6)
